{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月19日 09:55 星期四</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月19日 10:08 星期四</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>國家主席習近平周四（19日）上午在深圳主持亞太經合組織第三十三次領導人非正式會議。會議開始前，習近平同與會嘉賓親切握手並集體合影。（新華社）</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:23:57.759731+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:55:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:28.084436+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:33.282608+00:00","content_hash":"ef32987fa1658be1b3d07f7c73978f63e01ac329920e8a171d45911d38830aeb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}